WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:08.550
Daisy: Hi, Kara.

2
00:00:08.551 --> 00:00:15.918
Kara: Come on in.

3
00:00:15.919 --> 00:00:25.336
We can work on our poster in the kitchen.

4
00:00:25.337 --> 00:00:27.877
I'll draw all the landmarks. You

5
00:00:27.878 --> 00:00:31.830
can color everything in. Daisy:

6
00:00:31.831 --> 00:00:34.605
I like to draw too, you know.

7
00:00:34.606 --> 00:00:37.507
Kara: What?

8
00:00:37.508 --> 00:00:45.610
Daisy: Oh, never mind.

9
00:00:45.611 --> 00:00:48.213
Kara: That's not a good color for the slide.

10
00:00:48.214 --> 00:00:51.408
And the brick path looks really messy. Daisy:

11
00:00:51.409 --> 00:00:56.028
Kara! Stop bossing me around!

12
00:00:56.029 --> 00:00:57.545
I'm the one who's coloring! Not

13
00:00:57.546 --> 00:00:59.319
you! Kara:

14
00:00:59.320 --> 00:01:02.802
Well, I'm the one who's doing most of the work.

15
00:01:02.803 --> 00:01:06.618
Not you!

16
00:01:06.619 --> 00:01:13.874
Daisy: Fine. You can do ALL the work!

17
00:01:13.875 --> 00:01:16.503
Kara: Wait, Daisy. Don't go!

18
00:01:16.504 --> 00:01:18.001
Daisy: Why not?

19
00:01:18.002 --> 00:01:20.857
Kara: Because we're supposed to work

20
00:01:20.858 --> 00:01:24.120
together. And . . . I made something for you.

21
00:01:24.121 --> 00:01:25.609
Daisy: Really?

22
00:01:25.610 --> 00:01:33.135
Kara: Yes. Wait right here.

23
00:01:33.136 --> 00:01:35.636
It's a necklace.

24
00:01:35.637 --> 00:01:38.241
Daisy: It looks just like the one I lost!

25
00:01:38.242 --> 00:01:39.631
Kara: I know.

26
00:01:39.632 --> 00:01:42.297
Daisy: Wow. It's beautiful.

27
00:01:42.298 --> 00:01:44.991
That was so nice of you!

28
00:01:44.992 --> 00:01:46.504
Kara: I

29
00:01:46.505 --> 00:01:48.115
know. Now will you

30
00:01:48.116 --> 00:01:49.588
stay? Daisy: I guess

31
00:01:49.589 --> 00:01:51.648
so. Sorry about

32
00:01:51.649 --> 00:01:53.368
before. Kara: That's

33
00:01:53.369 --> 00:01:56.974
okay. But make sure you fix that messy

34
00:01:56.975 --> 00:02:11.256
spot. And the bike rack looks weird too . .

35
00:02:11.257 --> 00:02:14.939
. Miss Gray: Girls, your poster is

36
00:02:14.940 --> 00:02:23.980
beautiful. See what you can do when you work together?

37
00:02:23.981 --> 00:02:27.051
Jenna: It was nice that Kara made you a new necklace.

38
00:02:27.052 --> 00:02:30.318
Are you two friends now? Daisy:

39
00:02:30.319 --> 00:02:36.773
Umm . . . no. But I guess we're not enemies anymore!

